  "body": "Offering approximately 255m² of spacious multi-level living, this substantial four-bedroom home enjoys beautiful marina and sea views, freshly updated interiors and a fresh exterior finish - ready for its new owners to move in and enjoy.\r\n\r\nPredominantly constructed with Monier clay brick veneer over a drained cavity, finished with a selected texture coat. \r\n\r\nThe home also features compressed fibre cement architectural detailing on selected upper-level areas, balcony features and the garage gable.\r\n\r\nFRESHLY UPDATED\r\nFreshly repainted inside and out, including Dulux Weathershield exterior paint. Both main bathrooms and the separate guest powder room have also been updated with new vanities, toilets, fixtures and fittings.\r\n\r\nSPACE & FLEXIBILITY\r\nThe versatile multi-level layout offers:\r\n• Four double bedrooms, including a private master suite on its own level with walk-in wardrobe, ensuite and elevated marina and sea views.\r\n• Two bathrooms plus a separate guest toilet.\r\n• Multiple living areas and modern open-plan kitchen and dining.\r\n• Double internal--access garage plus off-street parking for two vehicles.\r\n\r\nCOASTAL GULF HARBOUR LIFESTYLE\r\nEnjoy being just minutes from Gulf Harbour Marina, cafés, restaurants, beaches, local schools, Shakespear Regional Park and the ferry terminal, with commuter connections to Auckland CBD.\r\n\r\nContact Olga Grinkevich today to arrange a private viewing or visit our open home.",
